  "description": "Comprehensive quantitative finance library with 180+ pure-math static methods and zero\n      external dependencies. Covers: options pricing (Black-Scholes, Garman-Kohlhagen, CRR\n      binomial tree, Longstaff-Schwartz Monte Carlo / LSM, exotic options, options on futures),\n      bond math (price, YTM, Macaulay/modified duration, convexity, DV01, yield curve\n      bootstrapping, mortgage amortisation), derivatives (interest rate swaps, forward rate\n      agreements, caps/floors/swaptions via Black's model, forward and futures pricing, Vasicek\n      and CIR short-rate models), credit risk (Merton structural model, CDS pricing via hazard\n      rates, distance to default), portfolio analytics (Markowitz mean-variance optimisation,\n      efficient frontier, risk parity, equity valuation multiples, fee calculations, performance\n      attribution via Brinson-Hood-Beebower, IRR, TWR, Modified Dietz), and risk metrics\n      (Sharpe, Sortino, Calmar, Treynor, Beta, Jensen's Alpha, VaR, CVaR, EWMA and GARCH\n      volatility models, tracking error, information ratio).",
